@page "/"
@attribute [Authorize(Policy = BackOfficePolicies.Viewer)]

<PageTitle>Overview - ledger-core</PageTitle>

<h1>Overview</h1>

<p>
    The back office for the ledger: accounts, their event history and transfers, read through the ledger API.
    It has no connection to the event store, so any change it makes goes through the same commands and checks as every other client.
</p>
